>What's the deal? Monster summoning?

Yes.

An '&' who is in melee range may, on its turn, summon another '&'.
(Exceptions: djinn, foocubi, balrogs, mail daemons, and Riders of the
Apocalypse do not have this power.) This has a small chance of resulting
in the appearance of a demon lord. (Demon lords have a chance of summoning
demon princes.)
